WEBVTT

00:14:29.792 --> 00:14:34.958
you will be recognizing yourself
as part of the great mortal us.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.518
Just as human,

00:14:37.542 --> 00:14:39.184
just as vulnerable

00:14:39.208 --> 00:14:41.958
as all the lives around you.

00:14:43.667 --> 00:14:46.976
Death matters because life matters,

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.809
and the two are indivisible.

00:14:49.833 --> 00:14:52.643
Don't worry if you feel awkward at first.

00:14:52.667 --> 00:14:56.434
Practice, practice, practice,

00:14:56.458 --> 00:14:58.476
until it's just like getting in that car

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.934
and going and you don't even
think about it.